#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:5
msgid "class RTC -- real time clock"
msgstr "klasa RTC -- sat stvarnog vremena"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:7
msgid "The RTC is an independent clock that keeps track of the date and time."
msgstr "RTC je nezavisni sat koji prati datum i vrijeme."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:10
msgid "Example usage::"
msgstr "Primjer korištenja::"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:18
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktori"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:22
msgid "Create an RTC object."
msgstr "Stvara RTC objekt."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:26
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:30
msgid "Get or set the date and time of the RTC."
msgstr "Dohvaća ili postavlja datum i vrijeme RTC-a."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:32
msgid ""
"With no arguments, this method returns an 8-tuple with the current date and "
"time.  With 1 argument (being an 8-tuple) it sets the date and time (and "
"``subseconds`` is reset to 255)."
msgstr ""
"Bez argumenata, ova metoda vraća 8-torku s trenutnim datumom i vremenom.  S "
"1 argumentom (koji je 8-torka) postavlja datum i vrijeme (a ``subseconds`` "
"se resetira na 255)."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:36
msgid "The 8-tuple has the following format:"
msgstr "8-torka ima sljedeći format:"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:38
msgid "(year, month, day, weekday, hours, minutes, seconds, subseconds)"
msgstr ""
"(godina, mjesec, dan, dan u tjednu, sati, minute, sekunde, subseconds)"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:40
msgid "``weekday`` is 1-7 for Monday through Sunday."
msgstr "``weekday`` je 1-7 za ponedjeljak do nedjelje."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:42
msgid "``subseconds`` counts down from 255 to 0."
msgstr "``subseconds`` odbrojava od 255 do 0."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:46
msgid ""
"Set the RTC wakeup timer to trigger repeatedly every ``timeout`` "
"milliseconds. This trigger can wake the board from both sleep states: "
":meth:`pyb.stop` and :meth:`pyb.standby`."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja RTC mjerač vremena za buđenje da se okida ponovljeno svakih "
"``timeout`` milisekundi. Ovaj okidač može probuditi ploču iz oba stanja "
"mirovanja: :meth:`pyb.stop` i :meth:`pyb.standby`\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:50
msgid "If ``timeout`` is ``None`` then the wakeup timer is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ``timeout`` jednak ``None`` tada je mjerač vremena za buđenje "
"onemogućen."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:52
msgid ""
"If ``callback`` is given then it is executed at every trigger of the wakeup "
"timer. ``callback`` must take exactly one argument -- the :class:`RTC` "
"instance that fired the wakeup."
msgstr ""
"Ako je zadan ``callback`` tada se izvršava pri svakom okidanju mjerača "
"vremena za buđenje. ``callback`` mora primiti točno jedan argument -- "
"instancu :class:`RTC` koja je pokrenula buđenje."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:58
msgid ""
"Get information about the startup time and reset source. The returned 32-bit"
" integer is a bit-packed value:"
msgstr ""
"Dohvaća informacije o vremenu pokretanja i izvoru resetiranja. Vraćeni "
"32-bitni cijeli broj je bitovno pakirana vrijednost:"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:65
msgid "Bits"
msgstr "Bitovi"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:66
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Značenje"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:67
msgid "``0x0000FFFF``"
msgstr "``0x0000FFFF``"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:68
msgid "Number of milliseconds the RTC took to start up."
msgstr "Broj milisekundi koliko je RTC-u trebalo za pokretanje."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:69
msgid "``0x00010000``"
msgstr "``0x00010000``"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:70
msgid "Set if a power-on reset occurred."
msgstr "Postavljeno ako je došlo do resetiranja pri uključivanju napajanja."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:71
msgid "``0x00020000``"
msgstr "``0x00020000``"

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:72
msgid "Set if an external reset occurred."
msgstr "Postavljeno ako je došlo do vanjskog resetiranja."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:76
msgid "Get or set the RTC smooth-calibration value."
msgstr "Dohvaća ili postavlja vrijednost glatke kalibracije RTC-a."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:78
msgid ""
"With no arguments, ``calibration()`` returns the current calibration value, "
"an integer in the range ``[-511, 512]``. With one argument it sets the "
"calibration."
msgstr ""
"Bez argumenata, ``calibration()`` vraća trenutnu vrijednost kalibracije, "
"cijeli broj u rasponu ``[-511, 512]``\\ . S jednim argumentom postavlja "
"kalibraciju."

#: ../../library/pyb.RTC.rst:82
msgid ""
"The smooth-calibration mechanism adjusts the RTC clock rate by adding or "
"subtracting the given number of ticks from the 32768 Hz clock over a "
"32-second period (2^20 clock ticks). Each positive tick speeds the clock up "
"by 1 part in 2^20 (≈0.954 ppm); negative values slow the clock by the same "
"amount per tick. The usable calibration range is therefore approximately "
"``-487.5 ppm`` to ``+488.5 ppm``."
msgstr ""
"Mehanizam glatke kalibracije prilagođava brzinu RTC sata dodavanjem ili "
"oduzimanjem zadanog broja otkucaja od sata od 32768 Hz tijekom razdoblja od "
"32 sekunde (2^20 otkucaja sata). Svaki pozitivni otkucaj ubrzava sat za 1 "
"dio u 2^20 (≈0,954 ppm); negativne vrijednosti usporavaju sat za isti iznos "
"po otkucaju. Korisni raspon kalibracije stoga je približno ``-487.5 ppm`` do"
" ``+488.5 ppm``\\ ."
